@keycloak = http://localhost:8180/realms/shifts/protocol/openid-connect/token
@api = http://localhost:8080/api

### Login ADMIN
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=shift-dev&username=admin.teste&password=Teste@123

### Login COORDENADOR
# @name loginCoord
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=shift-dev&username=coord.teste&password=Teste@123

### 1. ADMIN cria um profissional (201)
POST {{api}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Souza",
  "email": "maria.souza@teste.com",
  "phone": "31999990000",
  "registrationNumber": "CRM-MG 12345",
  "accessProfile": "PROFESSIONAL",
  "professionId": 1
}

### 2. E-mail duplicado (422)
POST {{api}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Outra Maria", "email": "MARIA.SOUZA@teste.com", "accessProfile": "PROFESSIONAL", "professionId": 1 }

### 3. Profissão inexistente (422)
POST {{api}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Joao Lima", "email": "joao.lima@teste.com", "accessProfile": "PROFESSIONAL", "professionId": 999 }

### 4. COORDENADOR cria PROFISSIONAL (201)
POST {{api}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoord.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Costa", "email": "ana.costa@teste.com", "accessProfile": "PROFESSIONAL", "professionId": 2 }

### 5. COORDENADOR tenta criar ADMIN (403)
POST {{api}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoord.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Espertinho", "email": "esperto@teste.com", "accessProfile": "ADMIN", "professionId": 3 }

### 6. Listar usuários (200)
GET {{api}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}